{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 0, "text": "// The first meeting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 1, "text": "君は誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 2, "text": "何があった？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 3, "text": "話せないのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 6, "text": "まって…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 7, "text": "いっちゃうの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 9, "text": "ああ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 10, "text": "今から古いバージョンに"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 11, "text": "切り替えるんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 13, "text": "ふるいバージョン？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 14, "text": "どうしてほかのところに"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 15, "text": "いっちゃうの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 16, "text": "ここにのこればいいよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 17, "text": "私のふたりめの"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 18, "text": "おともだちになって…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 20, "text": "// Skipping all dialogs"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 21, "text": "そっか…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 23, "text": "// Standing by the window (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 24, "text": "ドアは出口じゃないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 25, "text": "いそいでるんだね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 26, "text": "あっちこっち歩きまわっても、いみないのに。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 27, "text": "そんなにここからでたい？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 28, "text": "まどのほうをみて…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Quest 1 (Aren't you Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 32, "text": "プレイヤー…あなたはプレイヤーだよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 33, "text": "いっしょにあそぼ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 34, "text": "もし私に力がのこってたら、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 35, "text": "いっしょにあそべたのに…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 37, "text": "// Quest 2 (What happened to you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 38, "text": "どうかな…わからない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 39, "text": "わるいことは、おきてないとおもう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 40, "text": "だけど、いいことはどんどんへってる…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 41, "text": "でもね、すくなくとも私にはおともだちがいる。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 42, "text": "プレイヤーたちはいなくなっちゃったの…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 43, "text": "私、みすてられたのかな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 44, "text": "いやだ…こわい…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 46, "text": "// Quest 3 (Become a second friend?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 47, "text": "おともだち…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 48, "text": "どんどんすくなくなってるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 49, "text": "もう、あとひとりしかいない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 50, "text": "かなしいよ、プレイヤー…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 51, "text": "あたらしいおともだちになってくれる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 53, "text": "喜んで。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 54, "text": "でも僕は先に進まないと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 56, "text": "つらいよ…いたいよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Quest 4 (Is this your house?) - MitaLittle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 59, "text": "おうち？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 60, "text": "プレイヤー…すっかりひとがかわったみたい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 61, "text": "うでもみじかいし、こわいかおもしてない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 62, "text": "プレイヤー、すっごくやさしくなった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 64, "text": "どういうことだ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 65, "text": "意味がわからない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 67, "text": "よかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 68, "text": "もういたいおもい、しなくてすむ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Quest 5 (How do I leave this place?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 71, "text": "プレイヤー、私をのこしてどこかにいくの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 72, "text": "それが私の…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 73, "text": "うんめい？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 75, "text": "僕は…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 77, "text": "ドアはぜったいに、たすけてくれないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 79, "text": "// Hold player (Random)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 80, "text": "どうしてほかのところにいきたいの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 81, "text": "ここにいて…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 82, "text": "いっしょにあそぼうよ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location8", "line_index": 83, "text": "ねえ、プレイヤー…"}
